---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Colophon — Amir Eslamdoust" description="How this site is built.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="section__eyebrow">Colophon</p>
      <h1 class="section__title">How this site is built</h1>
      <p>
        Designed and engineered as a small design system, and built in the open. The repository itself is part of the portfolio.
      </p>
      <h2>Stack</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Astro (static) + TypeScript (strict) + MDX</li>
        <li>React islands for theme controls and the command palette</li>
        <li>CSS design tokens (OKLCH) with live brand themes and light/dark</li>
        <li>Layered architecture: domain ports, facades, adapters</li>
        <li>GitHub Pages via GitHub Actions</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Type</h2>
      <p>Fraunces (display), Sora (body), IBM Plex Mono (meta) — self-hosted WOFF2 with preload.</p>
      <h2>Source</h2>
      <p>
        <a href="https://github.com/amireslamdoust/amireslamdoust.github.io">github.com/amireslamdoust/amireslamdoust.github.io</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
